WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:45.670 --> 01:47.360
Toru! Let's go!

01:47.900 --> 01:48.830
Okay!

01:56.180 --> 01:59.010
Toru-sama and Noboru-sama. Your attire...

01:59.210 --> 02:01.050
School is starting again today.

02:01.380 --> 02:03.110
The second term is starting.

02:05.690 --> 02:08.160
Didn't you get enough rest?

02:08.660 --> 02:11.450
I was finishing off my
summer vacation homework...

02:11.730 --> 02:13.320
I was working on the family budget...

02:15.160 --> 02:16.650
We're in the red again.

02:19.400 --> 02:22.200
Bye! We're going now, Ko-chan.

02:22.770 --> 02:24.830
Please take care.

03:04.780 --> 03:06.580
We'll be in the red again this month.

03:11.050 --> 03:16.010
Our Fox Deity, Goes to Work

03:27.240 --> 03:29.860
We'll have to cut back a lot more this month...

03:31.170 --> 03:34.140
Meringue Shoppe, 10th Anniversary Sale
Sale! Sale! Sale!

03:34.140 --> 03:35.070
Sale! Today Only! Limited Stock!

03:36.380 --> 03:42.320
That's cheap! A six pack of large eggs for 68 yen?!

03:42.320 --> 03:45.320
- That's an impossible price! I have to get it!

03:45.320 --> 03:45.810
- Takagami.
- That's an impossible price! I have to get it!

03:47.860 --> 03:49.980
Oh, Sakura.

03:50.760 --> 03:52.230
Good morning.

03:52.860 --> 03:55.060
G-Good morning.

03:56.860 --> 03:59.770
Takagami is smiling at me...

03:59.770 --> 04:01.760
I get the feeling this'll be a great second term!

04:02.440 --> 04:04.770
This is my chance for us to grow even closer!

04:04.770 --> 04:07.240
Strike while the iron's hot, they say...

04:08.510 --> 04:10.500
Hey, about today...

04:11.150 --> 04:12.910
You know how the club isn't meeting?

04:13.310 --> 04:17.110
How about we walk home together?

04:17.220 --> 04:18.050
No!

04:19.050 --> 04:21.280
A limited time sale?!

04:22.920 --> 04:25.020
Sorry. Just not today.

04:25.130 --> 04:27.030
Oh, really...

04:27.030 --> 04:28.700
Did you have to go somewhere?

04:28.700 --> 04:35.100
I guess I can't tell her the 68 yen
6 pack of large eggs is calling me...

04:36.040 --> 04:38.530
Y-Yeah... Something like that.

04:39.170 --> 04:40.140
Sorry.

04:41.480 --> 04:43.670
It's okay.

04:56.260 --> 05:00.130
All the financial burdens on this family are my fault.

05:02.430 --> 05:04.360
Yet, I still...

05:05.130 --> 05:09.130
If only the Hashirame-sama were here,
I could ask for her advice.

05:10.710 --> 05:11.760
Advice?

05:13.540 --> 05:15.510
Or talk about our problems and worries and stuff...

05:17.910 --> 05:19.280
Misaki-sama!

05:24.190 --> 05:28.220
I wonder what he had to do...
He was kind of beating around the bush...

05:28.220 --> 05:30.880
Could he be going on a date?!

05:31.390 --> 05:34.420
Is it with Ko-chan?! Or Tenko-san?!

05:34.900 --> 05:35.690
Misaki-sama.

05:36.630 --> 05:38.100
Oh hi, Ko-chan.

05:38.770 --> 05:41.640
Good. It wasn't with Ko-chan...

05:41.640 --> 05:42.170
Excuse me?

05:42.170 --> 05:43.600
N-Nothing...

05:44.340 --> 05:45.900
Anyway, what's up?

05:46.610 --> 05:49.770
Oh, you broke a window...

05:50.110 --> 05:52.240
Yes. What should I do?

05:58.350 --> 06:00.450
Help Wanted

06:01.690 --> 06:03.680
How about a part time job to pay for it?

06:04.190 --> 06:04.930
Part time job?

06:04.930 --> 06:08.100
- Yeah, you take orders, then bring out food...

06:08.100 --> 06:09.150
- Green Tea Anmitsu, was it?
- Yeah, you take orders, then bring out food...

06:13.030 --> 06:16.340
So it means to enter an apprenticeship.

06:16.340 --> 06:21.300
That's an... unusual way of putting it.

06:21.480 --> 06:24.470
That's great. One of my workers
had to quit all of a sudden.

06:24.680 --> 06:26.700
Can you start tomorrow?

06:27.250 --> 06:29.250
It's good you found work so fast.

06:29.250 --> 06:32.480
Yes. I will fulfill the duty given unto me...

06:33.290 --> 06:34.980
Even if it may cost me my life.

06:41.660 --> 06:42.720
A part time job?!

06:43.160 --> 06:44.720
Why all of a sudden?

06:49.770 --> 06:51.470
The wind feels nice!

06:51.640 --> 06:52.610
Yeah!

06:52.810 --> 06:53.830
I get it...

06:53.980 --> 06:56.940
I will pay for it! Even if it may cost me my life!

06:57.480 --> 06:59.070
Don't worry about it.

06:59.710 --> 07:03.950
I can't allow myself to be any more of a nuisance.

07:05.450 --> 07:08.320
Well, if you really want to...

07:10.120 --> 07:12.060
Please have some if you'd like.

07:12.530 --> 07:14.260
I received it at the place I am
to become an apprentice at.

07:14.760 --> 07:15.790
For free?

07:15.930 --> 07:16.490
Yes.

07:16.730 --> 07:18.400
Toru-sama, please have some.

07:18.400 --> 07:20.830
Yay! Thanks, Ko-chan!

07:22.400 --> 07:24.460
I'll do it! I want to work part time, too!

07:24.570 --> 07:26.560
It's not like with the buffet, you know?

07:28.340 --> 07:31.830
Can she really handle the work?

07:33.110 --> 07:34.270
Welcome.

07:39.620 --> 07:40.810
Give me a bigger smile.

07:45.490 --> 07:47.360
Just give it some practice, okay?

07:48.000 --> 07:51.190
Welcome. Thank you very much.

07:51.600 --> 07:52.590
What will be your order?

07:52.770 --> 07:54.260
Welcome!

07:54.600 --> 07:56.700
You can just keep that up.

07:57.470 --> 07:59.570
I don't remember hiring her.

08:02.880 --> 08:05.370
You'll want to hire me...

08:05.580 --> 08:08.170
I want... to hire... you...

08:12.320 --> 08:14.410
I'll be sure to work hard!

08:19.230 --> 08:21.290
Is Ko-chan going to be okay?

08:21.860 --> 08:22.730
Sakura?

08:25.700 --> 08:26.830
Takagami...

08:27.100 --> 08:28.070
What are you doing here?

08:28.170 --> 08:29.970
I was just a bit worried about Ko-chan.

08:30.200 --> 08:31.470
You, too?

08:31.770 --> 08:34.240
Wait. You, too?

08:40.920 --> 08:43.610
I guess this is like a date, right?

08:43.990 --> 08:45.690
Yay!

08:45.690 --> 08:47.310
I'm so happy, I could die!

08:49.120 --> 08:50.390
Hey, Sakura!

08:51.560 --> 08:52.820
Tenko-san!

08:53.290 --> 08:56.000
Do you work here, too?

08:56.000 --> 08:57.230
Yup! Starting today!

08:57.700 --> 08:58.600
What'll you have?

09:00.070 --> 09:01.900
I'll have the cream anmitsu.

09:03.400 --> 09:04.670
I'll take the mitsumame.

09:05.040 --> 09:07.100
Anyway, how is Ko doing?

09:07.480 --> 09:08.810
She's good for now.

09:09.940 --> 09:13.610
Takagami looks really worried about Ko-chan...

09:13.920 --> 09:15.650
Is it because she broke the window?

09:15.650 --> 09:18.210
But that can't be something
that happens all the time...

09:18.520 --> 09:19.510
H-Hey!

09:25.130 --> 09:26.390
There she goes...

09:28.430 --> 09:30.000
I am terribly sorry...

09:30.000 --> 09:32.860
Don't worry. You'll get used to the work very soon.

09:33.330 --> 09:36.540
The mitsumame sounds great,
but so does the anmitsu.

09:36.540 --> 09:41.600
Maybe I should get the warabimochi.
But it's been a while since I had tokoroten jelly.

09:41.780 --> 09:44.440
I can't decide!

09:48.020 --> 09:50.610
Those kinds of people are the worst.

09:50.750 --> 09:52.310
You'll get used to it soon.

09:52.520 --> 09:57.010
Here you go. The cream anmitsu, mitsumame,
tokoroten jelly and warabimochi are ready.

09:57.460 --> 09:59.190
The cream anmitsu is...

10:00.560 --> 10:03.330
Sorry to keep you waiting.
Here is your cream anmitsu.

10:03.930 --> 10:06.020
Um... This is tokoroten jelly.

10:08.370 --> 10:09.930
I am terribly sorry...

10:10.640 --> 10:13.160
You should get used to the work soon.

10:13.470 --> 10:14.910
Which one are you getting?

10:15.040 --> 10:17.680
There's so many I can't decide!

10:17.680 --> 10:19.200
Yeah, me too!

10:20.010 --> 10:22.510
If you can't decide, order all of them!
ALL of them!

10:24.150 --> 10:26.140
How could you say that to the customer?!

10:27.190 --> 10:30.490
I'm sorry! This is her first part time job!

10:30.490 --> 10:33.190
I'm really sorry! I really am!

10:33.830 --> 10:35.960
Why is Takagami apologizing for her?

10:36.200 --> 10:39.630
Is he whipped at home or something?!

10:40.230 --> 10:42.430
When did they get so close?!

10:51.110 --> 10:52.140
Oh, whoops.

10:52.650 --> 10:54.580
I'm terribly sorry.

11:00.990 --> 11:04.480
It might be rude to say this,
but is Ko-chan just a klutz?

11:05.260 --> 11:07.490
Is that why Takagami is so worried about her?

11:09.000 --> 11:11.660
It's okay. I'll do the rest.

11:13.630 --> 11:15.070
Now what?!

11:15.540 --> 11:18.410
Oh, my! I'm so sorry!

11:18.410 --> 11:22.270
I should apologize, too! It's her first part
time job and she's causing so much trouble...

11:22.980 --> 11:26.640
Is Takagami whipped by Ko-chan, too?

11:26.780 --> 11:30.720
Or is she blackmailing him because
she knows some huge secret?

11:32.750 --> 11:34.720
Those two can be such a headache...

11:35.460 --> 11:37.820
Manager, we have trouble!

11:39.160 --> 11:41.150
I need to eat some to make
this whole thing worthwhile.

11:46.170 --> 11:47.270
- This is good!

11:47.270 --> 11:49.040
- Why is she eating them?!
- This is good!

11:49.040 --> 11:49.900
I... don't know.

11:54.940 --> 11:56.530
I am terribly sorry!

11:59.610 --> 12:02.410
You two are fired!

12:02.780 --> 12:03.680
Fired...

12:05.090 --> 12:07.150
I'm so sorry!

12:25.310 --> 12:26.740
First she gets fired...

12:26.810 --> 12:27.110
- Then they made me pay for everything.

12:27.110 --> 12:30.270
- This is good.
- Then they made me pay for everything.

12:31.380 --> 12:32.900
I am terribly sorry.

12:33.410 --> 12:35.750
I just became even more trouble for you...

12:36.220 --> 12:37.740
But next time!

12:38.090 --> 12:40.220
You're going to do it again?!

12:40.220 --> 12:42.620
What should I pick next?

12:50.100 --> 12:51.500
You're so hired!

12:54.640 --> 12:56.400
This might work.

12:57.610 --> 12:58.730
What will you have?

12:59.610 --> 13:01.670
Um... This...

13:01.980 --> 13:03.100
Just one of them, please.

13:03.340 --> 13:05.280
Would you like fries with that?

13:05.450 --> 13:07.710
Sure, I'll take some fries...

13:08.120 --> 13:09.380
Would you like a salad, too?

13:10.280 --> 13:11.810
Okay... That, too.

13:12.090 --> 13:13.680
How about some chicken nuggets on the side?

13:13.850 --> 13:14.790
Sure...

13:15.260 --> 13:17.120
Would you like some ice cream for dessert?

13:17.120 --> 13:18.520
Yes, please!

13:19.590 --> 13:21.490
Thank you very much.

13:24.370 --> 13:25.390
He looks so cute!

13:25.870 --> 13:27.700
H-He's pretty popular...

13:29.100 --> 13:31.330
Well, he is good-looking...

13:32.810 --> 13:37.370
Oh, no! I have Takagami! How could I think that?

13:38.380 --> 13:41.870
They'd probably all freak
out if they knew he's a fox.

13:42.520 --> 13:45.380
By the way, where's Ko-chan?

13:50.090 --> 13:51.960
Can you be the fry cook?

13:52.060 --> 13:52.580
Sure.

13:54.630 --> 13:57.720
One hamburger and one vanilla ice cream, please!

14:03.840 --> 14:05.270
Here it is!

14:05.440 --> 14:07.880
Here's where that really
good-looking guy is working at!

14:07.880 --> 14:08.780
There he is!

14:08.780 --> 14:09.910
I can't see!

14:09.910 --> 14:10.770
He looks dreamy!

14:14.080 --> 14:16.050
Look over here!

14:16.050 --> 14:17.420
He looks so much better in person!

14:17.480 --> 14:18.750
Hey, our eyes met!

14:21.260 --> 14:22.350
What is this?!

14:26.230 --> 14:27.630
You wanted these deep fried, right?

14:28.700 --> 14:29.750
You're fired...

14:33.530 --> 14:34.940
So what are you going to do next?

14:34.940 --> 14:37.640
I haven't had some crab in a while.

14:37.640 --> 14:42.410
Please, just stop! If I get any
deeper in the red, we'll go bankrupt!

14:42.910 --> 14:45.810
At least let me pay for the window.

14:49.880 --> 14:51.780
Did you find anything?

14:53.290 --> 14:54.550
How about you?

14:56.420 --> 14:58.430
Come on, people.

14:58.430 --> 14:59.990
This isn't a library.

14:59.990 --> 15:02.790
Oh, you're looking for a part time job.

15:03.330 --> 15:04.800
Why don't you work here?

15:08.040 --> 15:11.840
Oh. Ebisu's place started doing pizza deliveries.

15:12.170 --> 15:14.280
Let's try it out.

15:14.280 --> 15:16.810
Sure. I'll come to personally deliver it.

15:16.810 --> 15:17.900
This time...

15:19.180 --> 15:20.440
So I just have to deliver it, right?

15:24.290 --> 15:26.950
Make sure you exchange it for money!

15:32.660 --> 15:33.990
I will be going now.

15:36.500 --> 15:38.290
Do it right, 'kay?

15:38.670 --> 15:39.790
I pick this one!

15:43.200 --> 15:47.470
Hello. I'd like to order a pizza...

15:57.480 --> 15:59.250
Tenko-sama!

16:11.700 --> 16:13.220
The pizza sure is taking a long time.

16:13.400 --> 16:15.530
What is Ku doing?

16:16.370 --> 16:17.300
There we go.

16:26.380 --> 16:29.180
I ordered 2 hours ago! What's going on?!

16:29.550 --> 16:30.980
I'm really sorry!

16:34.760 --> 16:35.280
Hello?

16:35.620 --> 16:37.090
How long are you going to keep me waiting?!

16:37.360 --> 16:39.290
I'm really sorry!

16:40.230 --> 16:41.990
That was easy!

16:42.760 --> 16:44.370
Easy my ass!

16:44.370 --> 16:46.830
I'm getting complaints from
people who never got their pizza!

16:46.830 --> 16:49.000
What the hell is going on?! Did you eat them all?!

16:49.240 --> 16:51.500
Don't be stupid. I delivered them.

16:51.840 --> 16:53.270
Then show me the money.

16:53.270 --> 16:55.040
Money? What are you talking about?

16:55.380 --> 16:56.870
I told you to exchange it for money!

16:57.040 --> 16:57.940
You never said that.

16:58.210 --> 16:59.080
Yes, I did!

16:59.080 --> 17:00.340
No, you didn't!

17:02.320 --> 17:03.550
Excuse me...

17:03.550 --> 17:04.980
We didn't get our pizza...

17:07.690 --> 17:08.550
What happened here?

17:08.820 --> 17:10.650
See?! I told you so!

17:10.890 --> 17:12.690
But I made all the deliveries!

17:26.140 --> 17:28.740
Why would it be gone if you made the deliveries?

17:28.740 --> 17:31.040
You probably just left it at the door.

17:31.250 --> 17:33.540
Maybe some crows took it.

17:33.680 --> 17:37.120
Just tell us the truth, tenko-dono.

17:38.190 --> 17:39.650
You ate them, didn't you?

17:40.050 --> 17:41.450
Just be sure you pay for all of it.

17:42.520 --> 17:44.120
Ku-chan would never do that!

17:45.790 --> 17:48.790
Then find the culprit and bring him to me!

17:51.900 --> 17:54.370
Okay, let's try to recreate what
you did for the deliveries.

17:54.370 --> 17:55.030
Sure.

17:58.970 --> 18:00.770
There's your problem!

18:02.480 --> 18:03.200
Somebody's coming!

18:08.820 --> 18:12.220
Nooo! I missed the catch!

18:13.190 --> 18:14.810
So she's the culprit?

18:14.990 --> 18:17.360
Looks like it. Look at the all
the pizzas she's carrying...

18:17.360 --> 18:18.520
I'll get her back for this!!

18:19.930 --> 18:21.800
Tenko-sama!

18:21.800 --> 18:22.660
What?!

18:25.870 --> 18:28.030
You must be new, too.

18:29.300 --> 18:30.400
How do I get to here?

18:30.640 --> 18:32.300
Uhh...

18:33.340 --> 18:34.030
Hey!

18:35.580 --> 18:37.480
Ko-chan! Perfect timing!

18:40.150 --> 18:42.120
Why did you steal my pizzas?

18:42.220 --> 18:43.550
You like pizzas?

18:44.750 --> 18:47.220
I like tenko-sama-meow!

18:48.160 --> 18:50.420
Teehee! I said it!

18:54.630 --> 18:56.150
You're not human...

18:57.300 --> 18:58.130
Right...

18:58.270 --> 19:00.760
So she's like... Ku's fan.

19:02.640 --> 19:03.570
Fan?

19:06.410 --> 19:08.070
That's mine!

19:09.040 --> 19:09.940
Yes!

19:12.150 --> 19:15.480
I fell for you the moment I laid eyes on you-meow!

19:16.950 --> 19:18.540
Is that why you took the pizzas?

19:18.720 --> 19:24.210
Yes. The pizzas you delivered
tasted wonderful-meow.

19:24.560 --> 19:28.900
Can you tell that to the owner
of the convenience store?

19:28.900 --> 19:30.420
There's no need for that.

19:31.370 --> 19:32.600
But...

19:32.600 --> 19:34.660
Can you swear to never do it again?

19:36.600 --> 19:38.330
If you give me your autograph...

19:39.910 --> 19:41.370
Oh, fine...

19:44.080 --> 19:45.700
Thank you so much!

19:46.010 --> 19:48.150
I'll make this my family heirloom-meow!

19:48.150 --> 19:50.880
How could you let the criminal go?

19:50.980 --> 19:53.580
No fan of mine is a criminal!

19:54.220 --> 19:56.160
Guess I'll have to pay up again...

19:56.790 --> 19:58.280
I'm fired again...

20:00.690 --> 20:02.890
You're leaving?! Why?

20:03.430 --> 20:05.500
I tried to work and pay for the damages...

20:05.500 --> 20:09.270
...but I've only created more
trouble for Noboru-sama.

20:09.440 --> 20:14.140
But Takagami knows you were trying really hard.

20:14.140 --> 20:15.670
There's no need to leave...

20:16.340 --> 20:17.540
But...

20:25.450 --> 20:26.510
Where are you going?

20:34.530 --> 20:36.720
You can't leave now.

20:37.760 --> 20:41.030
That isn't enough to cover for the window.

20:45.010 --> 20:45.900
Yes.

20:50.180 --> 20:51.370
That's a relief...

20:51.550 --> 20:53.840
Wait, no it's not!

20:54.350 --> 20:58.590
What am I doing, helping a love rival?!
I'm so stupid!

20:58.590 --> 21:00.280
Wait, why am I even here?

21:04.260 --> 21:07.460
By the way, where were you planning on going?

21:14.200 --> 21:15.860
On top of the tree in the yard?

21:16.540 --> 21:17.160
Yes...

21:26.350 --> 21:32.810
sora no hate ga tsunagaru basho wo
Where the horizon meets the earth,

21:33.290 --> 21:40.490
no ni saku hana wa mada kitto shiranai
The flower growing in the wild remains unaware.

21:41.860 --> 21:48.360
Kokoyori ii sekai ga aruto
While thinking that there
is a world better than this.

21:48.500 --> 21:56.140
Kokoro wa itsumo hane wo hirogetagaru
They always desire to spread
the wings of their hearts.

21:57.040 --> 22:04.080
Yume dakede owarasenai
Don't let it end as just a dream,

22:04.690 --> 22:11.180
chansu ga aru hazusa
There's always a chance.

22:11.390 --> 22:18.830
Daijoubu bokura wa hitori janai
It's all right. We are not alone.

22:18.830 --> 22:26.440
Kaze ga nanika wo iouto shiteru
The winds are telling us something.

22:26.440 --> 22:34.110
Daijoubu kanarazu umaku yareru
It's all right. You can do it.

22:34.110 --> 22:45.360
Omoi wa itsuka jibun wo kaeru michi ni naru
Those dreams are a path you'll change yourself.

22:49.660 --> 22:51.900
The hamburgers were great.

22:51.900 --> 22:52.420
Yeah.

